Third-party methodology
-----------------------
references/security-audit.md adapts the audit METHOD (reconnaissance,
coverage-led hunting, a candidate gate, independent validation, the
confirmed / needs_validation / rejected verdicts, and a report derived
only from verified records) of Cloudflare's security-audit-skill,
https://github.com/cloudflare/security-audit-skill, licensed under the
MIT License, Copyright (c) Cloudflare, Inc. No text or code from that
project is copied; its hunting modules, schema, validators and sandbox
procedure are not used.
The current version is recorded in the SKILL.md frontmatter (`metadata.version`)
and in CHANGELOG.md. The frontmatter is the source of truth.
